Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.78,0:00:02.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜游马：哈特被掳走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.64,0:00:07.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在我和快斗寻找哈特的时候出现在眼前的是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.74,0:00:11.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗，用双人决斗把这些家伙打趴下！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.62,0:00:14.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定要把哈特夺回来。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:16.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天啊，我！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.55,0:00:29.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）太美了。这就是星光体世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.30,0:00:36.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于来了啊，快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.07,0:00:46.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（众人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.57,0:00:52.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）来吧，我的粉丝福利时间开始了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.83,0:00:53.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）少开玩笑了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.52,0:00:55.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}敢对哈特出手，别以为
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.94,0:00:57.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还能从这里安然无恙地出去。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.37,0:00:59.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}挺有气势嘛，呵呵呵……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.49,0:01:04.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你旁边那个附赠的我也会让你跟朋友一个下场。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.11,0:01:08.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打倒你的人，就是我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.34,0:01:11.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）游马，别中了挑衅。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.86,0:01:13.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那正是他的战术。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.94,0:01:14.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.75,0:01:17.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才不会因为憎恨去决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.73,0:01:26.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（轨道7）快斗大人…… 喂 笨蛋 蠢货！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.03,0:01:27.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不许妨碍快斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.28,0:01:29.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）什么啊 那算什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.69,0:01:31.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为你是笨蛋 所以我才说你笨蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.87,0:01:33.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.60,0:01:35.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎～ 那个…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.66,0:01:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是敢小看游马我可饶不了你。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.66,0:01:39.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这个 废铁！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.96,0:01:41.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜 废铁…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.90,0:01:45.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个人 说不定比快斗大人还可怕。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.67,0:01:48.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！ 我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.73,0:01:52.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 机关傀儡 炸弹蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.43,0:02:01.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动炸弹蛋的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.64,0:02:05.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽 1回合1次 将1张手牌送入墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.62,0:02:08.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对方800点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.57,0:02:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一上来就来啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.98,0:02:13.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在组队决斗中 虽然最初的回合不能攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.07,0:02:14.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果伤害是另一回事。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.50,0:02:18.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将手牌中的机关傀儡 死灵人偶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.15,0:02:18.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送去墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.20,0:02:24.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就当是见面礼了。收下吧，快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.60,0:02:33.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.63,0:02:34.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你给我闭嘴。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.32,0:02:37.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛啊，我这不是在担心你嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.23,0:02:40.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.42,0:02:43.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，轮到你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.18,0:02:45.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要是磨磨蹭蹭的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.31,0:02:47.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特会怎么样，我可就不管了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.75,0:02:48.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.48,0:02:51.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.09,0:02:53.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动场地魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.33,0:02:55.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子压力世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.05,0:03:14.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？这里难道是宇宙？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.79,0:03:15.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.08,0:03:18.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～没法呼吸了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.73,0:03:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冷静点，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.41,0:03:19.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.60,0:03:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后我召唤光子粉碎者！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.42,0:03:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，由于场地魔法的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.03,0:03:33.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子怪兽的等级乘以100的伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.04,0:03:35.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对没有控制光子怪兽的玩家{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.99,0:03:37.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以给予。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.58,0:03:38.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.55,0:03:40.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等……等一下啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.77,0:03:42.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我根本就没有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.12,0:03:42.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子怪兽啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.38,0:03:45.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样的话连我也会受到伤害吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.17,0:03:47.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不需要你的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.62,0:03:47.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.23,0:03:50.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小春我会亲手夺回来。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.91,0:03:53.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吃下400点伤害吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.40,0:04:07.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 游马是同伴啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.99,0:04:09.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连同伴都不放过吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.98,0:04:12.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 正合我意。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.68,0:04:15.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖一张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.68,0:04:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗 你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.36,0:04:21.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.18,0:04:23.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然你打算这样，那我也奉陪！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.82,0:04:26.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等，游马，要赢下这场决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.30,0:04:27.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就必须和快斗合作。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.68,0:04:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又不是我的错是那家伙的错吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.89,0:04:35.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你忘了吗？这场决斗可不只是我们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.50,0:04:37.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还关系到哈鲁特的性命。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.04,0:04:44.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.12,0:04:49.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，你看来什么都不知道啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.77,0:04:54.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗，你是为了哈鲁特
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.27,0:04:56.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而被强迫战斗的可怜士兵。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.00,0:05:00.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}费卡博士和哈特兰德先生{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.45,0:05:02.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说是只要收集 No.卡，就会把哈鲁特的病
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.98,0:05:04.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给你治好。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.85,0:05:09.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然，你是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.75,0:05:12.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了哈鲁特的病才收集 No.卡……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.23,0:05:16.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）我为了弟弟把灵魂卖给了恶魔。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.41,0:05:21.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错！那家伙为了弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.81,0:05:24.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拼了命地在收集 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.58,0:05:27.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根本不管别人的灵魂。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.35,0:05:29.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是个感人的故事啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.68,0:05:31.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都让人想哭了。哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.23,0:05:33.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.13,0:05:36.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗……为什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.52,0:05:38.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么不告诉我们啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.36,0:05:41.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不需要你来同情！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.78,0:05:44.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}持有 No.卡的人总有一天我全都会猎杀！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.86,0:05:47.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也是，那些家伙也是，全部……。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.80,0:05:50.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗，你……。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.44,0:05:53.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不错嘛，不错嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.92,0:05:56.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被逼得走投无路了呢，快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.69,0:06:00.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}治好哈特……但是，那样的话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.74,0:06:04.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果我们把 No.卡都收集了，哈特就……。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.98,0:06:07.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，现在集中精力战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.21,0:06:10.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果输掉这场决斗，现在
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.08,0:06:12.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连夺回哈特都做不到。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.75,0:06:13.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.00,0:06:15.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.35,0:06:18.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（）我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.64,0:06:20.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}兄长大人，我来铺垫那个连招。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.99,0:06:21.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.06,0:06:24.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤欧帕兹怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.49,0:06:26.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黄金 shuttle！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.44,0:06:32.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.87,0:06:35.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡 欧帕兹·共鸣！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.87,0:06:41.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以从手牌特殊召唤
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.90,0:06:44.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}比场上欧帕兹怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.42,0:06:46.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级高1的欧帕兹怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.18,0:06:50.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，欧帕兹怪兽 摩艾！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.90,0:06:55.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，发动黄金 shuttle 的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.20,0:06:57.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡1回合1次
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.88,0:06:59.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以提升1个等级。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.99,0:07:03.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，就有2只等级5的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.93,0:07:06.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级5的黄金 shuttle 和
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.39,0:07:07.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}摩艾叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.08,0:07:09.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.24,0:07:11.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.25,0:07:18.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.56,0:07:23.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.33！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.73,0:07:26.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}古代超兵器 马修·马克！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.72,0:09:16.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放两张卡回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.12,0:09:20.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、什么啊这体型……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.08,0:09:22.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来 他们持有的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.76,0:09:24.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡似乎不止一张。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.63,0:09:26.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别大意 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.75,0:09:28.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.77,0:09:32.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.26,0:09:35.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 我我我骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.86,0:09:46.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 在自己场地上通常召唤等级4的怪兽时
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.56,0:09:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以特殊召唤这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.56,0:09:50.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！ 影蜥蜴！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.34,0:09:54.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天吧 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.23,0:09:57.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 等级4的我我我骑士和
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.32,0:09:58.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}影蜥蜴 进行超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.10,0:10:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用两只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.28,0:10:06.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量网络构建！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.85,0:10:08.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.25,0:10:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦？还挺像模像样地超量召唤了嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.06,0:10:17.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.39！希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.40,0:10:26.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.99,0:10:27.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.95,0:10:33.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个少年……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.09,0:10:37.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）不可能。那小子居然有 No.……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.53,0:10:39.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他是 No.使者。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.39,0:10:42.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}兄长大人，之前那场决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.20,0:10:44.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}或许是我们大意了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.06,0:10:46.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他曾经看过我们的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.81,0:10:49.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要改变作战计划吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.52,0:10:51.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}兄长大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.12,0:10:57.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙，有点意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.02,0:10:59.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是连 No.都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.80,0:11:01.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那打倒他也没啥成就感。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.77,0:11:04.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，把卡盖上。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.25,0:11:07.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们俩都是 No.使者。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.34,0:11:08.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且还是个强敌。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.38,0:11:11.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗，可没有
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.27,0:11:12.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我藏着卡不用的余裕。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.69,0:11:17.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放两张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.97,0:11:24.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.88,0:11:26.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来才是演出的开始！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.32,0:11:29.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡，等级交错。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.68,0:11:33.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将一张手牌送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.43,0:11:36.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让一只等级4以下的怪兽等级翻倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.41,0:11:40.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将机关傀儡 死灵人偶送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.56,0:11:42.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让炸弹蛋的等级翻倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.98,0:11:45.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，我的墓地里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.25,0:11:47.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凑齐了两只死灵人偶{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.09,0:11:51.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其中一只除外，剩下的那一只就可以特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.71,0:12:02.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}两只等级8的怪兽……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.24,0:12:05.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要来了吗？那个 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.56,0:12:08.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级8的机关傀儡 炸弹蛋和
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.38,0:12:09.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}死灵人偶叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.35,0:12:17.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.70,0:12:19.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.10,0:12:21.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.73,0:12:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.15！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.10,0:12:27.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机关傀儡 巨人杀手！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.24,0:12:41.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是这家伙吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.47,0:12:43.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阶级8的 No.怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.92,0:12:45.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没想到这么快就出现了……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.63,0:12:47.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那只怪兽……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.78,0:12:51.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对铁男和委员长做了很过分的事……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.70,0:12:58.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动永续陷阱 No.之壁！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.26,0:13:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要这张卡存在
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.74,0:13:03.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上的 No.怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.62,0:13:07.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就不会被魔法 陷阱 怪兽效果破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.77,0:13:12.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.怪兽专用的陷阱！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.50,0:13:14.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会被效果破坏！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.58,0:13:15.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 情况不妙啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.15,0:13:18.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）现在就告诉你们。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.03,0:13:22.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巨人杀手 效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.72,0:13:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用一个叠放单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.93,0:13:27.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这张卡以外的怪兽·超量
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.65,0:13:28.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.71,0:13:35.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.76,0:13:39.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 连同伴的 No.卡也{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.90,0:13:41.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵 蠢货。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.08,0:13:44.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的 No.卡 凭借 No.墙的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.74,0:13:46.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到保护。 不会被破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.00,0:13:52.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恐怕 刚才那张陷阱是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.98,0:13:55.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}预判了巨人杀手能力的连招。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.01,0:13:56.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.72,0:13:59.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们落入了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.25,0:14:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们两人设下的陷阱。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.72,0:14:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普的效果 不能用吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.87,0:14:06.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.64,0:14:12.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}月之屏障只能对攻击发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.08,0:14:20.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.72,0:14:24.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 巨人杀手还会
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.62,0:14:27.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予被破坏的怪兽攻击力数值的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.55,0:14:30.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予控制怪兽的玩家。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.30,0:14:42.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.00,0:14:48.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了！巨人杀手的攻击力是 1500{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.09,0:14:49.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巨人杀手的攻击还没结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.80,0:14:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是挨下那招……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.29,0:14:56.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶～！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.36,0:14:59.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，特殊召唤伤害法师。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.58,0:15:00.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我、我知道啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.31,0:15:04.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将伤害法师以守备表示特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.80,0:15:11.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在受到效果伤害时
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.15,0:15:12.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.18,0:15:15.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，恢复与所受效果伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.61,0:15:16.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等量的生命值！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.32,0:15:21.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧！居然回复生命值了真没意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.44,0:15:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，发动魔法卡攻击装置！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.66,0:15:31.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据这个效果，巨人杀手的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.76,0:15:34.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到结束阶段，提升500点。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.77,0:15:39.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再加上，受到这家伙效果的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.48,0:15:41.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗中破坏怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.45,0:15:45.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会按照被破坏怪兽的攻击力数值
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.01,0:15:46.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给对手造成伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.15,0:15:49.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}做好觉悟吧，快斗首先，就从你开始！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.07,0:15:53.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巨人杀手！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.13,0:15:55.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对快斗的光子粉碎者发动攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.49,0:16:00.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会！？攻击力明明相同应该是同归于尽才对啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.97,0:16:02.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巨人杀手是 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.51,0:16:04.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗中不会被破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.83,0:16:08.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最终之舞！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.17,0:16:11.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，接下这2000点的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.06,0:16:12.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伤害吧，快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.21,0:16:23.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.67,0:16:28.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.52,0:16:36.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样你还能猎取我的灵魂吗？快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.60,0:16:46.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动了陷阱卡攻击无敌化！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.56,0:16:47.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.68,0:16:52.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击无敌化可以无效战斗与效果
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.34,0:16:53.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}造成的破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.35,0:16:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要光子粉碎者不被破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.60,0:16:58.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗就不会受到伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.20,0:17:02.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧！连保护快斗的手段都盖伏好了吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.74,0:17:03.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.55,0:17:08.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 是打算护着我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.31,0:17:10.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才不是 我可没那个意思！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.74,0:17:12.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么啊 那个人！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.96,0:17:14.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明是被游马救了的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.37,0:17:18.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱歉 快斗大人就是那样的人……。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.32,0:17:21.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说过了吧不会借你们的手。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.81,0:17:24.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拥有 No.卡的人 全都是敌人！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.88,0:17:28.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗…… 是星光体的指示吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.78,0:17:30.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不对！ 是我自己的意志！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.16,0:17:34.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要是说我是敌人的话那当敌人也无所谓。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.18,0:17:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是我和哈鲁特约好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.60,0:17:40.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙一直想见你。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.88,0:17:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以无论如何我都要把你带到哈鲁特那里去！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.99,0:17:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真火大！你们这帮家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.47,0:17:50.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的服务全都给我拒绝了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.48,0:17:53.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么不让我痛痛快快地决斗啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.29,0:17:57.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想看你们痛苦的样子啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.76,0:17:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、什么啊！？那个人……。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.50,0:18:01.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了，等等。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.89,0:18:03.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想到个好主意。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.16,0:18:08.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然你们不喜欢我之前的服务，那我就给你们别的服务。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.72,0:18:10.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个的话你们应该会喜欢吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.13,0:18:18.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.74,0:18:26.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特。哈鲁特！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.09,0:18:29.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是你心爱弟弟的现场直播。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.52,0:18:33.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你对哈鲁特做了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.94,0:18:35.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个嘛，做了什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.19,0:18:38.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老哥做的事可比我狠多了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.34,0:18:41.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过那副样子，不快点阻止的话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.37,0:18:42.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会很不妙吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.37,0:18:44.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}兄长大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.89,0:18:45.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.84,0:18:48.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好表情啊，快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.51,0:18:50.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这不是能做到嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.91,0:18:53.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看着你那副装模作样的脸逐渐扭曲
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.06,0:18:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是让人欲罢不能的快感啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.03,0:18:58.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可原谅！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.12,0:19:04.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《来吧，呼唤吧。试着呼唤吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.57,0:19:05.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的王牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.85,0:19:08.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那一刻就是你的死期，快斗》
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.31,0:19:11.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.48,0:19:14.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，快斗，冷静点。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.95,0:19:16.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤光子斩击者。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.73,0:19:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 就在这一瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.87,0:19:26.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子压力世界的效果 发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.14,0:19:29.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子怪兽被召唤时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.37,0:19:32.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有控制光子怪兽的玩家{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.29,0:19:35.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到被召唤怪兽的等级乘以100的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.01,0:19:42.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凡是妨碍我的人统统排除。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.29,0:19:44.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.70,0:19:46.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来快斗的场上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.01,0:19:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就有了2只攻击力2000以上的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.15,0:19:51.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将攻击力2000的光子粉碎者和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.89,0:19:54.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力2100的光子斩击者解放。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.55,0:20:03.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪耀于黑暗的银河啊 化作希望之光寄宿于我身。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.51,0:20:06.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光之化身 在此降临。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.87,0:20:11.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 银河眼光子龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.20,0:20:14.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.90,0:20:17.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（）这就是传闻中的银河眼。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.43,0:20:19.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 一切都在计算之中。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.77,0:20:20.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}动手吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.15,0:20:22.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了，兄长大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.19,0:20:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不好。光子压力世界的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.05,0:20:30.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果又要发动了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.12,0:20:42.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，银河眼。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.03,0:20:43.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击巨神杀手。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.04,0:20:47.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破灭的光子流！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.79,0:20:49.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}中计了，快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.66,0:20:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动永续陷阱。巨石阵护盾。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.12,0:20:59.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将对方场上原本攻击力3000以上的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.50,0:21:01.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只怪兽的攻击无效{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.04,0:21:04.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且将其攻击力变为零，
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.18,0:21:06.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽效果也无效化。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.98,0:21:16.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.73,0:21:20.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来银河眼的攻击力就是0了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.11,0:21:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且怪兽效果也被无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.72,0:21:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是看穿了银河眼能力的陷阱。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.61,0:21:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全都是圈套吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.08,0:21:30.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}欧帕兹怪兽 玛修·马克的效果发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.25,0:21:34.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}玛修·马克在场上怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.42,0:21:35.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力发生变化时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.28,0:21:38.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消耗一个叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.32,0:21:41.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对方相当于变化后攻击力数值的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.69,0:21:44.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，马修·麦克。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.62,0:21:46.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无限加农炮！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.91,0:21:51.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的银河眼攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.14,0:21:53.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从3000变成了0。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.19,0:21:55.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结束了，快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.04,0:21:58.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吃下这3000点伤害吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.12,0:22:01.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.24,0:22:03.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}

